  "historyNote": "#6091, INTERIM, eff 9-19-95, EXPIRED 1-17-96 New. #6187, eff 2-21-96; ss and moved by #6391, eff 11-28-96 (formerly Liq 406.04), EXPIRED: 11-28-04 New. #8243, eff 12-31-04, EXPIRED: 12-31-12 New. #10322, INTERIM, eff 4-25-13, EXPIRED: 10-22-13 New. #10643, eff 7-18-14; ss by #12081, eff 1-6-17; ss by #14335, eff 8-2-25, EXPIRES: 8-2-35",
